{"3179880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adrenalinkick", "steam_appid": 3179880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3692090], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Adrenaline Rush on two wheels now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re faced with a decision — at an average speed of over 250 km/h, right in the middle of rush-hour traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong choice, and even your guardian angel will abandon you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is inspired by the “legendary” Ghost Rider, who has already kept entire police units busy on international roads.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Important Notice:</u></strong><br>As the developer and publisher, we strongly advise against recreating this kind of behavior in real life. Never forget: you only have one life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endless tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four selectable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Streamer Editor”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable track advertising</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable motorcycle design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable license plate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheelie &amp; stoppie mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable cruise control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual weather settings in the pause menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial pages explaining the streamer mode and controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild swerving back and forth won’t get you to the finish line. The rule here is: drive with foresight and steer in time.<br>Controlling a motorcycle at over 250 km/h is a true art — it takes a steady hand and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you all reach the finish line safely — and enjoy a close race for the best distance.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Adrenaline Rush on two wheels now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re faced with a decision — at an average speed of over 250 km/h, right in the middle of rush-hour traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong choice, and even your guardian angel will abandon you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is inspired by the “legendary” Ghost Rider, who has already kept entire police units busy on international roads.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Important Notice:</u></strong><br>As the developer and publisher, we strongly advise against recreating this kind of behavior in real life. Never forget: you only have one life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endless tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four selectable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Streamer Editor”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable track advertising</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable motorcycle design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable license plate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheelie &amp; stoppie mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable cruise control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual weather settings in the pause menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial pages explaining the streamer mode and controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild swerving back and forth won’t get you to the finish line. The rule here is: drive with foresight and steer in time.<br>Controlling a motorcycle at over 250 km/h is a true art — it takes a steady hand and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\